// Per-machine secrets template. Copy to Secrets.xcconfig (gitignored)
// and fill in the values for release builds. Debug builds never read
// the DSN — CrashReporting.bootstrap is `#if !DEBUG`-gated.
//
//   cp Secrets.xcconfig.template Secrets.xcconfig
//   # then edit Secrets.xcconfig and paste the host+path portion of the
//   # DSN below — everything AFTER the `https://` scheme prefix.
//
// See docs/references/crash-reporting.md for the full pipeline.

// Host + path of the Sentry DSN URL, without the leading `https://`.
// xcconfig strips `//` as a comment delimiter, so the scheme is hard-
// coded in mac-Info.plist (`https://$(SENTRY_DSN_REST)`) and only this
// half travels through the variable. Empty is valid: the bootstrap
// rejects the bare-scheme value and the app launches without crash
// reporting.
//
// Example value:
//   SENTRY_DSN_REST = abc123@o0.ingest.sentry.io/0
SENTRY_DSN_REST =
